### Finding 2: Hardcoded Unchangeable Master Developer Backdoor Credentials & Duplicate Seed Staff Key
- **Classification:** Confirmed security vulnerability & Confirmed bug
- **Priority:** **P0 (Critical)**
- **File(s) and Function(s) Affected:**
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L1453-L1461) (`isDeveloperCredentials`), [`loginStaff`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L1484), [`deleteBranchPermanently`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L1570)
  - [`WaffleoSeedData.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/model/WaffleoSeedData.kt#L42-L59) (`defaultStaffAccounts`)
- **Root Cause:** `isDeveloperCredentials`, `loginStaff`, and `deleteBranchPermanently` hardcode `(cleanUser.equals("developer", ignoreCase = true) && passwordInput == "developer")`. Even if an administrator changes the `developer` account password, `"developer" / "developer"` permanently grants `StaffRole.DEVELOPER` privileges (including permanent branch deletion). Additionally, `WaffleoSeedData.defaultStaffAccounts()` defined two accounts with identical `(branchId = "Global", username = "kasir")`, colliding on document ID `global_kasir`.
- **How the Problem Occurs:** Any staff member or former employee who knows `"developer" / "developer"` can log in as Master Developer on any branch tablet and delete branches or alter financial records.
- **Business Impact:** Complete bypass of role-based access control (RBAC) and branch isolation.
- **Recommended Solution:** Authenticate `DEVELOPER` strictly against the stored account record (or Firebase Auth custom claims) once initial setup is complete, and deduplicate seed usernames *(duplicate `kasir` fixed to `kasir2` in Phase 3)*.
- **Verification Method:** Unit test [`defaultStaffAccounts_haveUniqueBranchUsernameKeys`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/test/java/com/example/ExampleUnitTest.kt#L801-L806) (executed and passed).

