### Finding 4: Store Close Auto-Finalizes Unprepared (`isPrepared == false`) Active Orders Without Deducting Stock, Plus Refund Transfer `"Kas"` Account Mismatch
- **Classification:** Confirmed bug
- **Priority:** **P0 (Critical — Fixed in Phase 3)**
- **File(s) and Function(s) Affected:**
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L5629-L5670) (`syncPosSalesToMoneyManager`)
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L5808-L5849) (`syncPosSalesForDateKey`)
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L5158-L5199) (`calculateMoneyAccountBalances`)
- **Root Cause:**
  1. When closing the store, `syncPosSalesToMoneyManager(triggeredByStoreClose = true)` selected all `status == "ACTIVE" && it.isPaid && !isBackdatedOrder(it)` orders—even when `isPrepared == false`—and forced them to `status = "DONE"` inside an asynchronous coroutine without deducting raw material stock, while synchronously calling `syncPosSalesForDateKey` before the coroutine finished.
  2. In `syncPosSalesForDateKey`, cancelled paid orders generated an auto-refund transfer with `accountGroup = "Kas"` instead of `"Uang Tunai"` (the canonical group in `WaffleoSeedData.defaultMoneyAccountGroups`), and failed to exclude pure cash orders (`Tunai (Cash)`), creating phantom `"Kas"` balances and fake transfers to `Bank Mandiri` when a cash order was cancelled.
- **How the Problem Occurs:** Closing the store while a paid order (including any GrabFood/GoFood/ShopeeFood order, which is `isPaid = true` upon creation) is still being cooked wipes it from the kitchen queue without deducting ingredients. Cancelling a paid order corrupts Money Manager account balances on store close.
- **Business Impact:** Lost kitchen orders, unrecorded ingredient consumption, and inaccurate cash drawer and bank balances.
- **Recommended Solution:** Only auto-finalize active orders on store close when both `it.isPaid && it.isPrepared`, perform the state update and ingredient deduction synchronously before `syncPosSalesForDateKey`, exclude pure-cash orders from bank-to-cash refund transfers, and use `accountGroup = "Uang Tunai"`.
- **Verification Method:** Unit test [`refundTransfer_usesUangTunaiGroup_andIncrementalChangeDuePreventsDuplicateRefunds`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/test/java/com/example/ExampleUnitTest.kt#L808-L835) (executed and passed).

