### Finding 5: Destructive Substring Matching in Cloud Branch Deletion & Hardcoded `"Gabek"` Branch Identity Fallbacks
- **Classification:** Confirmed bug
- **Priority:** **P0 (Critical — Fixed in Phase 3)**
- **File(s) and Function(s) Affected:**
