  - [`WaffleoModels.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/model/WaffleoModels.kt#L881-L887) (`BranchProfile.displayName`)
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L507-L528) (`getBranchDisplayName`)
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L1582-L1596) (`deleteBranchPermanently`)
