### Finding 6: Stale `StateFlow.value` Reads (`SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed`) Causing Daily Order Sequence Collisions & Double-Tap Race Conditions
- **Classification:** Confirmed bug
- **Priority:** **P0 (Critical — Fixed in Phase 3)**
- **File(s) and Function(s) Affected:**
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L380-L505) (`allCatalogRecords`, `catalogRecords`, `allOrders`, `orders`, `auditLogs`) and [`lines 748-797`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L748-L797) (`moneyTransactions`, `dailyPosItemSummaryMap`, `moneyBookmarks`)
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L2718-L3885) (`submitCartToOrders`, `markOrderPaidInQueue`, `markOrderPreparedOneWay`, `completeOrderAndDeductStock`, `cancelOrderWithReason`, `eraseOrderAndRevertMetrics`, `deleteOrderRecord`)
- **Root Cause:**
  1. Derived `StateFlow` properties in `WaffleoViewModel` used `SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000L)`. When the cashier is on `MenusAndCartScreen` (which collects `catalogRecords`, not `allOrders` or `orders`) for >5 seconds, `allOrders` stops collecting upstream updates and `allOrders.value` freezes at its initial seed value. Reading `allOrders.value` inside `submitCartToOrders` or `orders.value` inside `syncPosSalesToMoneyManager` then operates on stale data!
  2. `submitCartToOrders` and queue action methods launched coroutines without an in-flight mutex/atomic guard, allowing rapid double-taps on "Add to Orders" or "Done!" to create duplicate orders or deduct ingredient stock twice.
- **How the Problem Occurs:** Cashier stays on the Menus screen for >5 seconds and submits orders, or double-taps action buttons on a tablet touchscreen.
- **Business Impact:** Duplicate order numbers, skipped orders during Store Close recap, double-deducted inventory, and duplicate orders.
- **Recommended Solution:** Use `SharingStarted.Eagerly` for core ViewModel `StateFlow`s, combine `allOrders.value + _localOrders.value` when computing `todayBranchOrders`, and guard `submitCartToOrders` and queue actions with atomic in-flight locks (`isSubmittingCart` and `inFlightOrderActionIds`).
- **Verification Method:** Verified via compilation and unit test suite execution (`testDebugUnitTest`).

