### Finding 8: Order Edit Payment Loss, Duplicate Refund Ledger Entries, and Permanent Order DeletionOrphaning Financial Recaps
- **Classification:** Confirmed bug
- **Priority:** **P1 (High — Fixed in Phase 3)**
- **File(s) and Function(s) Affected:**
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L3055-L3256) (`submitCartToOrders` edit branch)
  - [`WaffleoViewModel.kt`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L3880-L3931) (`deleteOrderRecord`)
  - [`firestore.rules:191-198`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/firestore.rules#L191-L198) vs [`firestore.test.js:127-128`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/firestore.test.js#L127-L128)
- **Root Cause:**
  1. When editing an existing order in the cart, `previousPaid` used `if (_cartIsPaid.value) _cartPaidAmount.value else 0L`, ignoring partial payments made in the cart during the edit; `splitCashAmount` and `splitQrisAmount` were not updated on `updatedOrder`; and editing an order that already had `changeDueAmount > 0L` appended a duplicate `CHANGE_REFUND_RETURN` ledger entry on every subsequent edit.
  2. `deleteOrderRecord` deleted the order from `_localOrders` and Firestore without restoring ingredient stock, restoring promo quota, or re-syncing Money Manager for that date! Furthermore, `firestore.rules:191` comments that order deletion is blocked (`allow delete: if false`) and `firestore.test.js:128` tests that `orderDoc.delete()` fails, whereas `firestore.rules:198` actually allows delete.
- **How the Problem Occurs:** Cashier edits a paid order multiple times or Owner permanently deletes a completed order from Order History.
- **Business Impact:** Corrupted payment ledger on edited orders, and inflated Money Manager revenue when completed orders are permanently purged via `deleteOrderRecord`.
- **Recommended Solution:** Fixed in Phase 3 by computing `incrementalChangeDue = (changeDue - currentEditing.changeDueAmount).coerceAtLeast(0L)`, preserving `splitCashAmount`/`splitQrisAmount` and `_cartPaidAmount.value` during order edits, and restoring stock, promo quota, and Money Manager recaps inside `deleteOrderRecord`.
- **Verification Method:** Unit test [`refundTransfer_usesUangTunaiGroup_andIncrementalChangeDuePreventsDuplicateRefunds`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/test/java/com/example/ExampleUnitTest.kt#L808-L835) (executed and passed).

