# 4. Complete Audit Findings

### 1. Functional Logic
- **[P0 — Fixed] Store ClosePremature Order Completion:** [`syncPosSalesToMoneyManager`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L5629) marked unprepared (`isPrepared == false`) paid orders as `DONE` on store close without deducting stock.
- **[P1 — Fixed] Order Edit Partial Payment & Duplicate Change Ledger:** [`submitCartToOrders`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L3055) ignored partial cart payments when ` _cartIsPaid.value == false`, dropped `splitCashAmount`/`splitQrisAmount` on edit, and added duplicate `CHANGE_REFUND_RETURN` ledger entries on repeated edits.
- **[P2 — Confirmed bug] Calculator Left-to-Right Evaluation Without Operator Precedence:** [`evaluateSimpleMathExpression`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/WaffleoComponents.kt#L1427-L1466) (and its duplicate in [`MoneyManagerScreen.kt:4064`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/screens/MoneyManagerScreen.kt#L4064)) evaluates expressions strictly left-to-right (`10000 + 5000 * 2` evaluates to `30000` instead of `20000`) using `Double` arithmetic.
- **[P2 — UX/Functional issue] Simulated Thermal Printing Only:** [`ThermalReceiptDialog`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/WaffleoComponents.kt#L2868-L2883) displays a banner (`"Struk ... berhasil dikirim ke printer thermal"`) without any Bluetooth socket or ESC/POS printer integration, and displays raw `order.branchId` (which can be a UUID) at [`line 2591`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/components/WaffleoComponents.kt#L2591).

### 2. Database (Cloud Firestore Schema & Rules)
- **[P1 — Confirmed bug] Rule vs. Test Contradiction on Order Deletion:** [`firestore.rules:191`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/firestore.rules#L191) comments `// ORDERS: Delete is permanently blocked (allow delete: if false)` and [`firestore.test.js:128`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/firestore.test.js#L128) asserts `await assertFails(orderDoc.delete())`, yet [`firestore.rules:198`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/firestore.rules#L198) has `allow delete: if isOwnerOrSharedWorkspace(userId) && isValidId(orderId);`.
- **[P1 — Architectural weakness] Unfiltered Collection Listeners Across All Branches & All History:** [`WaffleoRepository.observeOrders`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/repository/WaffleoRepository.kt#L59-L89), [`observeCatalog`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/repository/WaffleoRepository.kt#L95-L120), and [`observeMoneyTransactions`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/repository/WaffleoRepository.kt#L156-L189) attach real-time `SnapshotListener`s to entire subcollections without `.whereEqualTo("branchId", ...)` or date bounds.
- **[P2 — Missing capability] Missing Firestore Composite Indexes Configuration:** [`firebase.json`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/firebase.json) only configures `firestore.rules` and does not include a `firestore.indexes.json` file for server-side filtering/sorting by `(branchId, createdAt)` or `(branchId, dateKey)`.

### 3. Offline Storage
- **[P1 — Performance & Reliability concern] Monolithic `SharedPreferences` JSON Serialization on Main Thread:** [`WaffleoLocalStore`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/local/WaffleoLocalStore.kt#L58-L350) serializes the entire order history, catalog, and money transaction lists into single JSON strings in `SharedPreferences` on every state change, even though Room (`androidx.room:room-runtime:2.7.0`) is already declared in [`app/build.gradle.kts:101-103`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/build.gradle.kts#L101-L103).
- **[P2 — Potential risk] Firestore Native Offline Persistence Explicitly Disabled:** [`MainActivity.kt:94-97`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/MainActivity.kt#L94-L97) configures `MemoryCacheSettings.newBuilder().build()`, disabling Firestore's built-in IndexedDB/SQLite offline persistence and relying solely on `WaffleoLocalStore`.

### 4. Synchronization
- **[P0 — Fixed] Stale `StateFlow.value` Due to `SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000L)`:** Fixed by switching core ViewModel flows to `SharingStarted.Eagerly`.
- **[P1 — Architectural weakness] String-Key Outbox Without Per-Field Conflict Resolution or Exponential Backoff:** [`flushPendingOfflineOperationsToCloud`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L1217-L1334) tracks dirty entity IDs (`order:<id>`, `catalog:<id>`, `money_tx:<id>`) in `_pendingSyncKeys` and overwrites the entire Firestore document with the local snapshot on reconnect (last-writer-wins at the whole-document level), with a fixed 30-second loop (`startPeriodicBackgroundSyncLoop`).
- **[P1 — Confirmed bug] Promo Quota Race Condition Across Devices:** [`incrementPromoUsageCount`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L2702) increments `usedCount` inside `CatalogRecord.metadataJson` locally and writes the full `CatalogRecord` document to Firestore without `FieldValue.increment(1)` or a Firestore transaction, so two tablets checking out simultaneously overwrite each other's `usedCount`.

### 5. Financial Calculations
- **[P0 — Fixed] Cancelled Paid Order Refund Transfer Group Name (`"Kas"` vs `"Uang Tunai"`) and Cash Inclusion:** Fixed in [`syncPosSalesForDateKey`](file:///c:/Users/USER/Documents/fdrmnn/WAFFLEO%20POS/Waffleo-POS/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/viewmodel/WaffleoViewModel.kt#L5808-L5849).
